    "description": "ABC PreSchool Kids Tracing & Phonics Learning game (350+ Worksheets) is an educational app to help your toddler learn basic tracing starting from lines, phonics and trace the letters of the alphabet ABCs and numbers 1 to 10, shapes & colors. ABC Preschool Worksheets includes fun, educational activities for toddlers and kids! If your child is in kindergarden, or going to attend preschool, this is a free learning app for your children\r\n\r\nLooking for kids drawing games for free with alphabet games for toddlers? Try our abc games & free preschool games - mix of drawing for toddlers with alphabet for kids! Learning games for kids with abc games and letter trace help in early education. Kids Learn abcd and learn to write with activities like trace, abc writing while learning letters\r\n\r\nABC Learning apps for kids with tracing and phonics games. Learning of English letters, Learning numbers, Learning Shapes, Learning curves, slanting lines, straight line, simple lines and free drawings, colors and more other basic vocabulary. Any toddler, kindergartner or preschool age child can learn English and the English alphabet and numbers simply kids tracing letters by following their finger\r\n\r\nPreschool kids of age 3 and above can learn ABC Alphabets English and the numbers to learn how to write. Kids tracing games has toddlers focused on alphabet reading and writing numbers\r\n\r\nSuitable for kindergarten, toddlers, early learners, preschool and 1st grade kids, Alphabet Tracing games is an award-winning app used in schools. Kids learn to write letters of the alphabet, numbers and shapes. Early learners have five practice options: capital letters, lower-case letters, numbers, shapes or a simple coloring book in educational games for kids & learning games for toddlers age 3, abc writing practice app for free\r\n\r\n\u272a Features of ABC PreSchool Tracing & Phonics \u272a\r\n\r\n\u2605 Learn writing Alphabet and Numbers tracing - ABC for kids, learn Alphabets & Letters\r\n\u2605 Learn Colors while tracing letters and 123 counting\r\n\u2605 Fun phonics song animations from A to Z with abc games\r\n\u2605 Fun phonics ABC animations & counting numbers 1 to 10\r\n\u2605 Free Drawings & Free App, ABC games for toddlers\r\n\u2605 Start with abc games, tracing lines and curves to trace\r\n\u2605 Uppercase and lowercase letters to trace\r\n\u2605 A colorful early education app that helps children learn the English alphabet, Numbers, Shapes and Colors\r\n\u2605 Learning games for toddlers age 2: ABC tracing for kids\r\n\u2605 Tracing alphabets slate for kids\r\n\u2605 New Connecting Dots Worksheets\r\n\u2605 Learning games for kids from A to Z\r\n\r\nAbc games and coloring\r\n350+ images to color, paint, draw, or doodle. Let your kids doodle and show their art skills. From a variety of crayons, glitters and patterns to color\r\n\r\nLearning games for kids\r\nToddler learn Alphabet for Kids. Easy for kindergarten kids to learn the ABC's (English alphabet) and numbers by tracing the dashed lines. There is audio for each letter in abc games and number so your kids for sound familiarity\r\n\r\nLearning games for toddlers\r\nABC Preschool Kids Tracing & Phonics Learning games \u266c is a free phonics and alphabet teaching app that makes learning fun for children, from toddlers all the way to preschoolers and kindergartners. Learn A to Z with trace, letter, in this learning games for kids\r\n\r\nAbc kids alphabet letter free toddler school free educational learning game with letters for toddlers to learn shape of number and letter. New Kids alphabet games ABC for kids with ABC flashcards for kids game. ABC games for toddlers and babies will easy learn abcd games for kids free! Free App for learning ABC on android ! Get abc kids tracing and phonics for free & preschool games for little kids today.",
